&lt;li&gt;Partner with backend engineers across domains to drive adoption of framework updates, collect feedback, and improve developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Observability and Infrastructure teams to integrate telemetry, SLOs, and resilience practices directly into standard service templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security, privacy, and compliance guidelines are embedded directly into service contracts and framework templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical design reviews, RFCs, and code reviews, fostering high engineering standards within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help write clear documentation and guidelines to empower engineers across Vinted to adopt golden paths effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend engineering experience with solid system design skills and hands-on experience building scalable services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical expertise in designing API contracts, service startup patterns, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about developer experience, tooling, and enabling other engineers through well-designed software.&lt;/li&gt;
