&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our EMEA Data Science organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo and Wolt, powering decision-making across product, commercial and operational teams through experimentation, causal inference and deep business understanding. As part of DoorDash, our EMEA Data Science team brings together colleagues across Deliveroo and Wolt, creating opportunities to learn from different markets and tackle complex local-commerce challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Data Science Manager to shape data science strategy across a broad area of our Logistics organisation. You’ll combine strong people leadership, technical judgement and commercial thinking to help our teams make better decisions and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Logistics Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Logistics makes our marketplace work in the real world: connecting riders with orders and helping deliveries happen efficiently and reliably. The organisation works on problems such as predicting demand, improving delivery-time estimates, and matching orders with riders, all in an efficient way to ensure we can offer the most affordable pricing to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are interconnected challenges. Decisions about supply, incentives and network efficiency can affect consumers, riders and restaurant and retail partners at the same time. Data Science helps us understand those relationships, test new approaches and balance delivery reliability, rider experience and sustainable business economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s an environment where rigorous experimentation meets real-world complexity, and where your team’s work can shape both everyday operational decisions and longer-term product strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the data science direction and measurable impact of a broad Logistics problem space spanning multiple cross-functional teams. You’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set strategy and priorities with Product, Engineering and Operations leaders, focusing investment on the highest-impact opportunities across immediate needs and longer-term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a high-performing, inclusive team through hiring, coaching and performance management, growing leaders who can deliver independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide solutions to complex marketplace challenges, from balancing supply and demand to evaluating incentives and improving delivery performance and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical bar for experimentation, causal inference and analysis, staying close enough to challenge approaches and ensure decisions reflect real marketplace effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior stakeholders and align teams around shared outcomes, resolving competing priorities and turning evidence into product and operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly lead projects that resolve highly complex challenges, which often span across multiple parts of the business and unlock new vectors of impact, boosting company-level goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading and developing high-performing data science or closely related analytical teams, with responsibility for complex work spanning multiple teams or business areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting analytical strategy and allocating people and effort across competing priorities, with clear evidence of product, operational or commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundations in experimentation, causal inference and statistical analysis, with the judgement to select appropriate methods, challenge conclusions and coach experienced practitioners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to reason about interconnected systems and trade-offs, including how an intervention in one part of a marketplace can affect outcomes elsewhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing senior cross-functional leaders, aligning teams around shared goals and turning complex evidence into clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thoughtful approach to building teams: hiring, coaching, managing performance and developing future technical and people leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort creating structure in ambiguous environments, making pragmatic decisions with incomplete information and adapting as new evidence emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience developing other people managers would be particularly valuable. Experience in marketplaces, logistics, mobility, pricing, incentives or other operationally complex businesses is helpful, but not essential. We also value leaders who can bring relevant approaches from other domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to have worked on every problem listed here. We’re interested in the depth of your leadership, the quality of your judgement and the impact you enable through others.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

043243d3baa27cb6.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will be part of the central CRM &amp;amp; Ops team, composed of 18+ specialists, dedicated to driving and executing global strategic initiatives to grow and retain our New Customer base. Collectively, the team is targeted on growing orders, expanding our subscriber base, improving engagement metrics to retain Deliveroo customers. Serving as the voice of the customer, the CRM &amp;amp; Ops team does this by enhancing personalised user experiences, activating best-in-class campaigns, and putting relevancy at the heart of everything.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Marketing Manager within the Lifecycle CRM &amp;amp; Ops team you are the voice of Deliveroo when speaking with our customers across the globe. You&#39;ll operate under a hybrid work model, spending a minimum of three days a week at our London HQ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into the Senior Marketing Manager on the New Customer squad, and working closely with stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Global CRM, Marketing Promotions, and Data Science, You’ll be a technical, commercially minded CRM marketer who is hands-on in the tooling: building Lifecycle journeys, setting up experiments and audiences, and configuring promotions and in-app merchandising. You’ll have end-to-end ownership of the New Customer Lifecycle, from journey design and build through to measurement and ROI. You’ll also use personalisation and AI to make journeys more relevant. Your primary focus will be on creating customer-centric journeys that are highly relevant, using the right channels at the right time to deliver meaningful business impact, while working with local markets as you scale your initiatives internationally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with multiple stakeholders to support growing the new customer base by combining data-driven insights with CRM best practice to initiate and deliver programs internationally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and configure multi-channel journeys (email, push, in-app), including audience logic, triggers, testing and QA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build multi-variant Lifecycle experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create promotions for new customer acquisition and retention, ensuring accurate setup, targeting and tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage in-app merchandising placements, working with Product and Marketing Promotions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver personalisation at scale, and test where AI can improve content and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own operational delivery, optimisation, reporting of campaigns and weekly trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor and report on campaigns to stakeholders &amp;amp; propose/manage changes and optimisations where necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the New Customer Lifecycle Manager and Marketing Promotions teams to develop the global CRM new customers lifecycle strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders on key projects to create and implement test strategies that optimises performance of new &amp;amp; existing campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable with data targeting, segmentation &amp;amp; analysis - pulling it, manipulating it and interpreting it, whilst using marketing technology to help achieve customer touchpoints faster and more efficiently than ever before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovative ideas and solutions in response to business and customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular communication with stakeholders, such as the central marketing team, product and engineering teams and local markets, to ensure workloads &amp;amp; deadlines are managed efficiently (we love Slack channels for everything)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct post campaign reporting, pulling out the most interesting lessons and using these to guide your future ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree (Marketing or Business preferred) or strong relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 3+ years CRM experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can work in a fast-paced environment and prioritise workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail and campaign deadlines are adhered to, maintaining high standards of accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly computer literate with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTML familiarity (ability to understand where changes need to be made)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liquid logic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical knowledge in CRM automation development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and ability to coordinate with multiple stakeholders groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data visualisation tools &amp;amp; reporting experience (Looker preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM deployment experience (Braze or similar is a plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are transforming the way the world eats and shops by making access to food and products more convenient and enjoyable. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits in areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific, please ask your recruiter for more information..&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

3febaf49d4b98b9c.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, tens of millions of people come to Roblox to explore, create, play, learn, and connect with friends in 3D immersive digital experiences– all created by our global community of developers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Roblox, we’re building the tools and platform that empower our community to bring any experience that they can imagine to life. Our vision is to reimagine the way people come together, from anywhere in the world, and on any device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to connect a billion people with optimism and civility, and looking for amazing talent to help us get there.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A career at Roblox means you’ll be working to shape the future of human interaction, solving unique technical challenges at scale, and helping to create safer, more civil shared experiences for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a founding member of the Security Operations team in EMEA, you will join us at an exciting time in Roblox’s SIRT &amp;amp; SOC program. You will design and build the detections, automation and tooling that let a lean team monitor and protect players, developers, employees and the platform at global scale and serve as security incident commander in the region. This is a highly autonomous role where you will be a primary decision-maker, core to our mission to maintain a highly capable 24/7/365 monitoring and response capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While you will work in close collaboration with peers at our US West Coast Headquarters, the time difference requires an engineer who can operate independently, making critical decisions without immediate oversight. We favor engineering our way out of toil through automation, orchestration, detections-as-code, and risk-based prioritization,&amp;nbsp;while retaining the deep technical skills required to conduct detailed, hands-on analysis and lead response end-to-end when the situation warrants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based in London, UK. You will be working from a dedicated, private space located within a shared office environment, designed to enable collaboration while remaining secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Detection &amp;amp; Response Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, write, and maintain production-quality detections, automations and integrations (detections-as-code, SOAR playbooks, data and enrichment pipelines) that scale our monitoring capability and reduce manual toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Tooling &amp;amp; Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and improve the tooling the global SIRT/SOC depends on alert quality and enrichment, case-management integrations and automation that powers reliable &quot;follow-the-sun&quot; hand-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise High Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary Incident Commander for the European time zone, making critical, time-sensitive decisions independently before US HQ comes online. You will serve as the senior-most security engineering point of contact in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategy &amp;amp; Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape the technical direction of the detection &amp;amp; response engineering function, specifically architecting how global hand-offs and &quot;follow-the-sun&quot; models can be optimized and automated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Command Security Incidents:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure serious threats and impacts are understood, mitigated, and learned from with speed and professionalism, often leading responses end-to-end without immediate escalation paths during local hours — and turning what you learn into durable, automated detections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct Forensic Investigations &amp;amp; Threat Hunt:&lt;/strong&gt; Dig into complex context to determine whether threats exist, take decisive action and proactively hunt for anomalous activity in our signals, distinguishing outliers from threats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead High-Profile Responses:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Security and Engineering to lead responses to major vulnerabilities or platform-wide events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Legal, HR, Executive teams, and external partners (Developers &amp;amp; Customers). You will also travel semi-regularly to the USA to visit HQ, ensuring deep alignment with central engineering and security leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years across security engineering, Infosec, IT, Infra/SRE, and/or Incident Response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialization:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years specifically in Detection or Response, with a track record of &lt;em&gt;building&lt;/em&gt;, writing detections, automation or security tooling, not solely operating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable writing and reviewing production-quality code (Scripting) and building automations, integrations and data pipelines that others depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to work independently in satellite offices or distributed teams. You are comfortable being the &quot;person in charge&quot; during your shift and making calls that impact the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Command:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience operating as an incident commander. You can flex into deep engineering work but also possess the executive presence to coordinate responders and communicate status to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investigations:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level capability investigating threats in enterprise and production environments, taking ownership from identification to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge/Tools/Techniques:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of security tooling (SIEM, EDR, IDS/IPS, NDR, SOAR) and experience extending or building on it. You are proficient in applying Incident Response frameworks (NIST IR Lifecycle, Cyber Kill Chain, MITRE ATT&amp;amp;CK) to real-world scenarios, and you collaborate effectively with engineering colleagues, leveraging extensive expertise across infrastructure and technologies (Public Cloud, OS, Virtualization, Containerization, Networking, Build/Development infrastructure, and Hardware).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Cybersecurity, or a related technical field; advanced degree preferred or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Builder-Operator:&lt;/strong&gt; You would rather automate a problem out of existence than staff around it and you hold yourself to an engineering bar even under incident pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Strategic Self-Starter:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait for instructions. You identify gaps in coverage — especially those unique to regional or time-zone-specific challenges — and fix them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Detailed Thinker:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy exploring the details and considering the second- and third-order effects of your decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Eager Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are drawn to complex issues rather than avoidant of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emboldened to Make Change:&lt;/strong&gt; You instinctively ask what you can do to improve the situation rather than waiting to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelled by our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; You are driven by the opportunity to protect our community and the safe space we&#39;ve created.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Calculated Risk Taker:&lt;/strong&gt; You move fast, navigating reasonable risks to take action and build capabilities as quickly as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Roles that are based in an office are onsite Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday, with optional presence on Monday and Friday (unless otherwise noted).&lt;/p&gt;
