&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;150&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build the cloud platform that turns Graphcore AI systems into usable, scalable services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;484&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Graphcore needs a Staff Cloud Engineer to develop and deploy private and public cloud services for AI compute. You will join the Cloud Platform team within Software Platform, close to datacentre operations and product development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;698&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your work will shape how internal users and customers access large-scale AI systems. You will keep critical infrastructure available while helping pre-release hardware and software become reliable cloud services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;700&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will operate and extend OpenStack-based services, automate deployment with infrastructure-as-code, and improve observability across the fleet. You will benchmark, validate and optimise systems spanning Graphcore hardware, servers, switches and storage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role suits someone who wants ownership of hard infrastructure problems, not a narrow ticket queue. Expect unproven components, direct user feedback, and decisions that move quickly into production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1182&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1182&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Cloud Platform team turns Graphcore products into large-scale AI solutions for internal users and customers. Work happens close to the systems, with engineers deploying, measuring and improving services directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will work with Software Platform, Datacentre Operations, Product Development, Engineering and QA. The team values people who take responsibility for unclear problems and make progress without waiting for perfect inputs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The team makes decisions from evidence: metrics, benchmarks, user impact and system behaviour. Engineers speak up, surface risks early and own corrective actions when systems need attention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A relevant degree or equivalent practical experience, with proven ability to scope and deliver technical infrastructure work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating on-premises or private-cloud environments, with strong ownership of end-user availability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong Linux system administration and scripting skills, including Bash and Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience deploying services with Infrastructure-as-Code, using tools such as Terraform/OpenTofu, Ansible or Packer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Practical understanding of cloud foundations, including virtualisation, virtual networks, block storage, monitoring and observability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;2553&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Git, CI or testing pipelines and container tools, with clear communication when supporting users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;2555&quot; data-end=&quot;2803&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. If you meet most of our essential criteria, we encourage you to submit an application and showcase how your background makes you a strong candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;2805&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;2805&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working:&lt;/strong&gt;Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous leave:&lt;/strong&gt; Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement planning support:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phantom equity:&lt;/strong&gt; Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peace of mind protection:&lt;/strong&gt; Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;3603&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optional benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot; data-start=&quot;3605&quot; data-end=&quot;3967&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
