&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Team &amp;amp; About Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik&#39;s sales organization helps hospitals, banks, schools and government agencies stay resilient against cyberattacks, malicious insiders and operational disruption, and unstructured data on NAS is one of the fastest-growing and most exposed corners of the data estate. As Regional Director for NAS Cloud Direct, you&#39;ll build and lead the team of Product Line Specialists who own this number across your region, and you&#39;ll set the standard for how Rubrik wins in this market. You&#39;ll work hand in hand with Core Account Executives, Sales Engineering, Sales Development, Channel Development and our partners within the One Rubrik selling motion, with the enablement, autonomy and ownership to take your team, your career and your earnings as far as your results allow. You&#39;ll also be the consolidated voice of the field and the customer back to Product Management, Product Marketing and PnP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own bookings growth and quota attainment for NAS Cloud Direct across the region, building a regional plan that helps more organizations protect massive volumes of unstructured data without adding on-prem backup infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, coach and develop a team of NAS Cloud Direct Sales Specialists, raising the bar on daily pipeline generation, net new logo acquisition and expansion within the existing Rubrik base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead from the front on strategic opportunities, joining key deals and guiding your team through complex data center and cloud design conversations and CxO-level selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a disciplined forecast and weekly operating rhythm, using MEDDPICC and COtM to keep pipeline honest and give leadership a number they can plan around&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with regional leaders in Core AE, Sales Engineering, Sales Development and Channel Development on coverage and account strategy, so specialists and Core AEs win together rather than compete for the same deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable, partner-led momentum with distributors, resellers and VARs, turning co-sell relationships into a growing share of regional pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion NAS Cloud Direct inside and outside Rubrik, enabling the field on positioning, objection handling and competitive differentiation so more teams can sell it with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market and customer feedback to Product Management and Product Marketing, shaping what we build next and how we take it to market, and share what&#39;s working with fellow Product Line Specialist leaders so the whole organization learns faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You&#39;ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leading quota-carrying field sales teams in technology, with a record of consistently overachieving as a leader and as a seller&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or leading sales of data protection, storage, cloud infrastructure or NAS-related solutions into enterprise and mid-enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building pipeline across many accounts and verticals and landing net new logos, and of coaching others to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort guiding sellers as they position a technical product in complex data center and cloud environments and build champions with technical and business buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with channel partners, distributors and resellers to co-sell and grow a territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting discipline, a structured approach to deal qualification, and experience recruiting and developing high-performing sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written, verbal and presentation skills, and the ability to influence peers, executives and cross-functional partners in sensitive situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to unstructured data challenges and enterprise NAS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading product-specialist or overlay sales teams alongside Core AE organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the competitive landscape in data protection and cloud storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MEDDPICC for sales qualification and the COtM sales methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (NYSE: RBRK) is the Security and AI Operations Company, delivering one platform built at the intersection of data, identity, and AI. The platform enables agentic cyber resilience and trusted AI operations for enterprises worldwide, built to recover before disruption strikes and stay a step ahead, so security is never the reason ambition stalls.&lt;/p&gt;
