&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automatisation, Développement &amp;amp; DevOps :&lt;/strong&gt; Python, Terraform, Ansible, FastAPI, CI/CD, AI Vibecoding&lt;/p&gt;
